OL,3,GNEWSABomb hoax arrest after homes
OL,4,Aevacuated
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fa bomb hoax after several homes were
OL,8,Fevacuated in a village in
OL,9,FNottinghamshire.
OL,11,FNottinghamshire Police said it was
OL,12,Fcalled to an address in Westdale Road
OL,13,Fin Jacksdale at about 07:50 BST on
OL,14,FThursday after a suspicious package was
OL,15,Ffound outside.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
