OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSABomb hoax arrest after homes
OL,4,Aevacuated
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force said "out of caution" nearby
OL,7,Fproperties were evacuated while
OL,8,Fexplosive ordinance disposal engineers
OL,9,Fcarried out further investigations. It
OL,10,Fconfirmed the incident had been "safely
OL,11,Fresolved" and residents were able to
OL,12,Freturn to their properties.
OL,14,FA 25-year-old man has been arrested on
OL,15,Fsuspicion of a bomb hoax and is being
OL,16,Fquestioned by officers, police added.
